  "category": "Martial Arts Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "In fights, they dominate with onslaughts of flowing, continuous attacks. With their sharp claws, they cut enemies.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "They have mastered elegant combos. As they concentrate, their battle moves become swifter and more precise.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "It takes pride in the speed at which it can use moves. What it loses in power, it makes up for in quantity.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "It takes pride in the speed at which it can use moves. What it loses in power, it makes up for in quantity.",
