    {
      "text": "In fights, they dominate with onslaughts of flowing, continuous attacks. With their sharp claws, they cut enemies.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "It takes pride in the speed at which it can use moves. What it loses in power, it makes up for in quantity.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "In fights, they dominate with onslaughts of flowing, continuous attacks. With their sharp claws, they cut enemies.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "They can often be seen in packs in the morning, slowly moving their bodies through a series of poses.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "They seclude themselves in the mountains and devote themselves to training. The form of their kicks and chops differs from pack to pack.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "In one minute, a well-trained Mienfoo can chop with its arms more than 100 times.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Though small, Mienfoo’s temperament is fierce. Any creature that approaches Mienfoo carelessly will be greeted with a flurry of graceful attacks.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
